  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10204462), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62942139), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000059858), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230888), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/a_moonlit_night)\n\nShe has a friend she only meets at night — her “night friend.” She doesn’t know his name, age, or any way to contact him; only his striking face and piercing eyes remain in her mind. After a month of their secret meetings, she suddenly sees him one day… in broad daylight, at her workplace.\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/175493)",
